    <string name="terms_dialog_title">Terms &amp; Conditions</string>
    <string name="terms_dialog_message">Welcome to MoneySnap. By using our app, you agree to comply with the following terms:\n\n1. App usage: The app provides personal expense tracking. You are responsible for keeping your account information secure.\n\n2. Privacy: Your financial data is stored securely. We do not share your data with third parties.\n\n3. Terms updates: We may update these terms to improve the service. Updates take effect when published.\n\nThank you for choosing MoneySnap!</string>
