    <string name="profile_help_title">Help centre</string>
    <string name="profile_help_message">• Adding an expense: tap + on the Home screen, or photograph a receipt to fill in the amount and date automatically.\n\n• Budget: set a monthly limit in Profile to be warned before you go over.\n\n• Sync: data is saved on the device first and pushed to the cloud when a connection is available. The app works offline.\n\n• New device: sign in with the same account and every expense is restored.</string>
